  "Main_findings": [
    "Actually viewed each of12rawnative PNG and3diagnosticpages. The8 itemcomponent files are one chosen four-slot plate configuration, not8designs;4worn layers likewise not4designs. Diagnostics are not native renderer or gameplay.",
    "Low arch helmet iron cap/face-rim plus darkbrown lower guards, shoulder-bright short chest and brown hem/cuffs, segmented straight legs/transparent crotch and high straight boots with instep leather bands are real visible material organization. Large discrete white/gray metal planes and compact brown connector areas serve simple oldmetal armor review; do not fill transparent voids or impose high boots on protected shortboots.",
    "Raw worn layer maps have contiguous light metal head/arms/body/feet regions; brown lower rectangles/belt regions are intentionally sparse. Alpha0/255 is case-specific and white pixels are foreground highlights. It does not authorize reducing original userart to16px/quantizing or destructive background removal.",
    "All25new source payloads matchSHA256/Gitblob against frozen tree. ThirteenJSONbusiness values read, including all4complete tool-definition modules; not fullupstreamproject or bootstrap reading. Separate two material renderJSON and4whole texture supplier classes read in full346Javalines, no new implementation/design credit forhelpers.",
    "Four default modules contain two tier1..2 randommaterialselectors, whereas current leatherdefinition is tier0. Thus chosen iron/leather must remain an explicitly selected study configuration, not guaranteed random default; stats-role compatibility alone is not proof a native obtainable stack was constructed.",
    "plate itemmodels explicitly tie platingindex0/mailleindex1; worn armor model requests platingfirst, maillefirst_present then trim. Leather renderinfo hasclothfallback, iron metal; without dyedmodifier/defaultColor the shown Dyed supplier returnsEMPTY. MaterialHasFallback checks current stringmaterial/renderinfofallback; First takes firstresult notEMPTY. Source-only normal fixedmaterials still depend actual loaded renderinfo/modifierstate.",
    "MaterialArmorTextureSupplier.materialGetter requires unqualified BASE texture to pass TEXTURE_VALIDATOR before trying material-specific variant; it can then prefer info.texture-specific path, fallbacks withvertexColor and finallybase. Presence of material-specific PNG alone is insufficient exact native binding. Constructor uses armor/leggings/wings suffix; actual material read from ToolStack stringlistindex. Missing/malformedmaterial string canempty-layer rather than prove broken art.",
    "Full MaterialModel sprite resolver, loaded MaterialRenderInfo/validator/resource fallback/cache lifetime and Mantle enum helper remain unclosed; current native renderer/NBT acquisition/five-view seam checks untested. No unconditional currentwear/render/admission/guaranteed default claim.",
    "Author saved prior hardleather/knight/knightly groups and D59/D76/D77/D78 observations read via comparison; Main did not reopen those original oldPNG/wholeobjects this round. Pixel-mask inequality and namespace do not close global semantic novelty. D79 supports maximum1prospectivewhole relevant design only; global acceptedtotal/gap remainnull, formalcredit0."
  ],
